{"metadata": {"title": "Geometry"}, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Geometry entries define reusable surface shapes. A geometry can be assigned to one or more elements in the layout, which keeps repeated shapes consistent across the scene.\n\nEdit the parameters for the selected shape type, then assign that geometry from the Layout panel.\n\nFor example, a circular aperture area is:\n\n"}, {"type": "math", "source": "A = pi r^2", "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 64.7434 15.0984\" width=\"64.7434pt\" height=\"15.0984pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xmlns:h5=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 14.9004)\"><use xlink:href=\"#g7B7C38C8034F1FEA39F5B99F8B5F9C66\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"/></g><g transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 18.5 14.9004)\"><use xlink:href=\"#gDA04E1CB9E3A508F478A2CF4E948C16A\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"/></g><g transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 37.504 14.9004)\"><use xlink:href=\"#gFF982F461CF0DEF4CE847C7B594B91F\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"/></g><g transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 48.214 14.9004)\"><use xlink:href=\"#g7B04CE027CE00757C776EEB3AB613DCB\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"/></g><g transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 56.566 8.3664)\"><use xlink:href=\"#gF675D545C78AD496DA511081741D052A\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"/></g><defs><symbol id=\"g7B7C38C8034F1FEA39F5B99F8B5F9C66\" overflow=\"visible\"><path d=\"M 0 0m 2.466 0.054c 0.324 0 1.44 -0.054 1.782 -0.054c 0.27 0 0.396 0.144 0.396 0.414c 0 0.162 -0.108 0.27 -0.342 0.288c -0.522 0.018 -0.774 0.198 -0.774 0.54c 0 0.162 0.162 0.522 0.504 1.062c 0.486 0.81 0.828 1.404 1.062 1.8h 4.374c 0 -0.126 0.018 -0.378 0.072 -0.774c 0.126 -1.314 0.198 -2.034 0.198 -2.124c 0 -0.342 -0.396 -0.504 -1.206 -0.504c -0.342 0 -0.504 -0.144 -0.504 -0.432c 0 -0.18 0.108 -0.27 0.324 -0.27c 0.432 0 1.8 0.054 2.232 0.054c 0.